From c1410549ccacf14641742a315e38f2bed54869c0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <assistant@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 20:38:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix Games and Quizzes missing from student navigation
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Navbar.js: add missing 'Quizzes' link (desktop + mobile) — it was
  never in the nav despite the /quizzes route working fine, so students
  browsing from any page other than the dashboard had no way to reach
  it. 'Games' was already present here.
- Dashboard Quick Links grid: add 'Games' card. Quizzes already has its
  own dashboard section with a 'View All' link; Games had no entry
  point on the dashboard at all.
- app/games/page.js: game_topics/game_sequence_steps are RLS-locked to
  authenticated reads only. A logged-out visitor or broken session
  silently gets zero rows (no error), rendering the exact same 'no
  games yet' message as a genuinely empty table. Added an explicit
  auth check so logged-out visitors see a login prompt instead of a
  misleading empty state.
- components/UnlockAwareNavbar.js: currently unused/unimported
  anywhere, but fixed two latent bugs so it's not a landmine if wired
  in later — missing 'React' import (used via React.Fragment, would
  throw ReferenceError on render) and missing 'Games' nav entry.
---
 Navbar.js                                     |  2 ++
 .../dashboard/DashboardWithUnlocks.js         |  1 +
 app/games/page.js                             | 29 +++++++++++++++++++
 components/UnlockAwareNavbar.js               |  4 ++-
 4 files changed, 35 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

